** Documentation

*** Overview

This system provides rich content inside footnotes for:
- LaTeX (bigfoot + custom environments)
- Typst (native + helpers)
- ConTeXt (native + helpers)  
- Org-mode (preprocessor auto-converts on export)
- Pandoc (PDF, DOCX, HTML via ox-pandoc)

All support:
- 20 levels of headings
- 20 levels of nested lists (itemize, enumerate, description)
- Tables with colspan/rowspan, captions, numbering
- Code blocks
- Nested footnotes (10 levels)

*** Quick Reference

| System  | Rich Footnote Command/Block                    |
|---------+------------------------------------------------|
| LaTeX   | =\\rfn{...}= or =\\rfnB{...}= etc.               |
| Typst   | =#rfn[...]= or native =#footnote[...]=         |
| ConTeXt | =\\startRFN= ... =\\stopRFN=                     |
| Org     | Auto-detected, or =#+BEGIN_RICHFN id= block    |

*** LaTeX Usage

**** Simple rich footnote:
#+begin_example latex
\\rfn{
  \\fnh{1}{Main Heading}
  
  \\begin{fnitemize}
    \\item First item
    \\begin{fnitemize}
      \\item Nested item
    \\end{fnitemize}
  \\end{fnitemize}
  
  \\begin{fntab}{|l|l|}{Table Caption}
    \\hline
    A & B \\\\
    \\hline
    \\multicolumn{2}{|c|}{Merged} \\\\
    \\hline
  \\end{fntab}
  
  \\begin{fncode}{python}
  def hello():
      print(\"Hello\")
  \\end{fncode}
}
#+end_example

**** Nested footnotes:
#+begin_example latex
\\rfn{
  Main content\\rfnmark{B}.
  \\rfntext{B}{
    Second level\\rfnmark{C}.
    \\rfntext{C}{Third level.}
  }
}
#+end_example

**** Heading levels (1-20):
=\\fnh{1}{...}= through =\\fnh{20}{...}=

**** List types:
- =\\begin{fnitemize}= ... =\\end{fnitemize}= (bullets)
- =\\begin{fnenumerate}= ... =\\end{fnenumerate}= (numbered)
- =\\begin{fndescription}= ... =\\end{fndescription}= (description)

*** Typst Usage

#+begin_example typst
#rfn[
  #fnh(1)[Main Heading]
  
  - List item 1
    - Nested item
  
  #fn-table(
    caption: \"My Table\",
    columns: 2,
    [A], [B],
    table.cell(colspan: 2)[Merged],
  )
  
  #fn-code(\"python\", `
  def hello():
      print(\"Hello\")
  `)
  
  #rfn[Nested footnote]
]
#+end_example

*** ConTeXt Usage

#+begin_example context
\\startRFN
\\fnh[1]{Main Heading}

\\startfnitemize
\\item First item
\\startfnitemize
\\item Nested
\\stopfnitemize
\\stopfnitemize

\\startfntable[caption={My Table}]
\\NC A \\NC B \\NC\\NR
\\NC \\use{2}{Merged} \\NC\\NR
\\stopfntable

\\startfncode[python]
def hello():
    print(\"Hello\")
\\stopfncode

\\startRFN
Nested footnote
\\stopRFN
\\stopRFN
#+end_example

*** Org Usage

**** Automatic detection:
Just write org syntax in footnote definitions:

#+begin_example org
Text with footnote[fn:1].

[fn:1] 
* Heading in Footnote

- List item 1
  - Nested item
- List item 2

| Col A | Col B |
|-------+-------|
| 1     | 2     |

#+begin_src python
def hello():
    print(\"Hello\")
#+end_src

Another footnote reference[fn:2].

[fn:2] Nested footnote content.
#+end_example

**** Explicit block (for complex cases):

#+begin_example org
#+BEGIN_RICHFN myid
* Heading

- List

| Table |

#+BEGIN_RICHFN nested1
Nested footnote
#+END_RICHFN

#+END_RICHFN

Reference with [fn:myid] in text.
#+end_example

** LaTeX Preamble

#+begin_src emacs-lisp
(defvar my/latex-rich-footnotes-preamble
  \"% ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
% RICH FOOTNOTES SYSTEM - Full document capability in footnotes
% ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

% ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
% NESTED FOOTNOTES (10 levels: default, B-J)
% ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
\\\\usepackage{bigfoot}
\\\\DeclareNewFootnote{default}
\\\\DeclareNewFootnote{B}
\\\\DeclareNewFootnote{C}
\\\\DeclareNewFootnote{D}
\\\\DeclareNewFootnote{E}
\\\\DeclareNewFootnote{F}
\\\\DeclareNewFootnote{G}
\\\\DeclareNewFootnote{H}
\\\\DeclareNewFootnote{I}
\\\\DeclareNewFootnote{J}

% Shortcuts
\\\\newcommand{\\\\rfn}[1]{\\\\footnote{#1}}
\\\\newcommand{\\\\rfnB}[1]{\\\\footnoteB{#1}}
\\\\newcommand{\\\\rfnC}[1]{\\\\footnoteC{#1}}
\\\\newcommand{\\\\rfnD}[1]{\\\\footnoteD{#1}}
\\\\newcommand{\\\\rfnE}[1]{\\\\footnoteE{#1}}
\\\\newcommand{\\\\rfnF}[1]{\\\\footnoteF{#1}}
\\\\newcommand{\\\\rfnG}[1]{\\\\footnoteG{#1}}
\\\\newcommand{\\\\rfnH}[1]{\\\\footnoteH{#1}}
\\\\newcommand{\\\\rfnI}[1]{\\\\footnoteI{#1}}
\\\\newcommand{\\\\rfnJ}[1]{\\\\footnoteJ{#1}}

% Marks and texts for manual nesting
\\\\newcommand{\\\\rfnmark}[1]{\\\\csname footnotemark#1\\\\endcsname}
\\\\newcommand{\\\\rfntext}[2]{\\\\csname footnotetext#1\\\\endcsname{#2}}

% ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
% HEADINGS IN FOOTNOTES (20 levels)
% ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
\\\\usepackage{xparse}

\\\\ExplSyntaxOn
\\\\NewDocumentCommand{\\\\fnh}{m m}{
  \\\\int_case:nnF {#1} {
    {1}  {\\\\par\\\\medskip{\\\\bfseries\\\\Large #2}\\\\par\\\\smallskip}
    {2}  {\\\\par\\\\smallskip{\\\\bfseries\\\\large #2}\\\\par\\\\smallskip}
    {3}  {\\\\par\\\\smallskip{\\\\bfseries #2}\\\\par\\\\smallskip}
    {4}  {\\\\par{\\\\bfseries\\\\small #2}\\\\par}
    {5}  {\\\\par{\\\\bfseries\\\\itshape #2}\\\\par}
    {6}  {\\\\par{\\\\itshape #2}\\\\par}
    {7}  {\\\\par{\\\\scshape #2}\\\\par}
    {8}  {\\\\par\\\\underline{#2}\\\\par}
    {9}  {\\\\par{\\\\sffamily\\\\bfseries\\\\footnotesize #2}\\\\par}
    {10} {\\\\par{\\\\sffamily\\\\footnotesize #2}\\\\par}
    {11} {\\\\par{\\\\ttfamily\\\\bfseries\\\\footnotesize #2}\\\\par}
    {12} {\\\\par{\\\\ttfamily\\\\footnotesize #2}\\\\par}
    {13} {\\\\par\\\\textemdash\\\\ {\\\\bfseries #2}\\\\ \\\\textemdash\\\\par}
    {14} {\\\\par\\\\textbullet\\\\ {\\\\bfseries #2}\\\\par}
    {15} {\\\\par[{\\\\bfseries #2}]\\\\par}
    {16} {\\\\par\\\\{{\\\\itshape #2}\\\\}\\\\par}
    {17} {\\\\par({\\\\small #2})\\\\par}
    {18} {\\\\par$\\\\triangleright$\\\\ #2\\\\par}
    {19} {\\\\par$\\\\diamond$\\\\ #2\\\\par}
    {20} {\\\\par#2:\\\\par}
  }{\\\\par{\\\\bfseries #2}\\\\par}
}
\\\\ExplSyntaxOff

% ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
% LISTS IN FOOTNOTES (20 levels)
% ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
\\\\usepackage{enumitem}
\\\\setlistdepth{20}

% Itemize (bullets)
\\\\newlist{fnitemize}{itemize}{20}
\\\\setlist[fnitemize]{nosep, leftmargin=*, labelindent=0pt}
\\\\setlist[fnitemize,1]{label=\\\\textbullet}
\\\\setlist[fnitemize,2]{label=\\\\textendash}
\\\\setlist[fnitemize,3]{label=\\\\textasteriskcentered}
\\\\setlist[fnitemize,4]{label=\\\\textperiodcentered}
\\\\setlist[fnitemize,5]{label=\\\\textopenbullet}
\\\\setlist[fnitemize,6]{label=\\\\textbullet}
\\\\setlist[fnitemize,7]{label=\\\\textendash}
\\\\setlist[fnitemize,8]{label=\\\\textasteriskcentered}
\\\\setlist[fnitemize,9]{label=\\\\textperiodcentered}
\\\\setlist[fnitemize,10]{label=\\\\textopenbullet}
\\\\setlist[fnitemize,11]{label=\\\\textbullet}
\\\\setlist[fnitemize,12]{label=\\\\textendash}
\\\\setlist[fnitemize,13]{label=\\\\textasteriskcentered}
\\\\setlist[fnitemize,14]{label=\\\\textperiodcentered}
\\\\setlist[fnitemize,15]{label=\\\\textopenbullet}
\\\\setlist[fnitemize,16]{label=\\\\textbullet}
\\\\setlist[fnitemize,17]{label=\\\\textendash}
\\\\setlist[fnitemize,18]{label=\\\\textasteriskcentered}
\\\\setlist[fnitemize,19]{label=\\\\textperiodcentered}
\\\\setlist[fnitemize,20]{label=\\\\textopenbullet}

% Enumerate (numbered)
\\\\newlist{fnenumerate}{enumerate}{20}
\\\\setlist[fnenumerate]{nosep, leftmargin=*, labelindent=0pt}
\\\\setlist[fnenumerate,1]{label=\\\\arabic*.}
\\\\setlist[fnenumerate,2]{label=\\\\alph*.}
\\\\setlist[fnenumerate,3]{label=\\\\roman*.}
\\\\setlist[fnenumerate,4]{label=\\\\Alph*.}
\\\\setlist[fnenumerate,5]{label=\\\\Roman*.}
\\\\setlist[fnenumerate,6]{label=(\\\\arabic*)}
\\\\setlist[fnenumerate,7]{label=(\\\\alph*)}
\\\\setlist[fnenumerate,8]{label=(\\\\roman*)}
\\\\setlist[fnenumerate,9]{label=[\\\\arabic*]}
\\\\setlist[fnenumerate,10]{label=[\\\\alph*]}
\\\\setlist[fnenumerate,11]{label=\\\\arabic*)}
\\\\setlist[fnenumerate,12]{label=\\\\alph*)}
\\\\setlist[fnenumerate,13]{label=\\\\roman*)}
\\\\setlist[fnenumerate,14]{label=\\\\Alph*)}
\\\\setlist[fnenumerate,15]{label=\\\\Roman*)}
\\\\setlist[fnenumerate,16]{label=\\\\arabic*-}
\\\\setlist[fnenumerate,17]{label=\\\\alph*-}
\\\\setlist[fnenumerate,18]{label=\\\\roman*-}
\\\\setlist[fnenumerate,19]{label=\\\\Alph*-}
\\\\setlist[fnenumerate,20]{label=\\\\Roman*-}

% Description
\\\\newlist{fndescription}{description}{20}
\\\\setlist[fndescription]{nosep, leftmargin=!, labelindent=0pt, style=nextline}

% ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
% TABLES IN FOOTNOTES (with colspan, rowspan, captions, numbering)
% ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
\\\\usepackage{tabularx}
\\\\usepackage{booktabs}
\\\\usepackage{multirow}
\\\\usepackage{makecell}
\\\\usepackage{caption}

\\\\newcounter{fntablecounter}

% Simple table: \\\\begin{fntab}{cols}{caption} ... \\\\end{fntab}
\\\\NewDocumentEnvironment{fntab}{m O{}}{%
  \\\\par\\\\smallskip
  \\\\refstepcounter{fntablecounter}%
  \\\\IfValueTF{#2}{%
    \\\\noindent\\\\textbf{Table~\\\\thefntablecounter:} #2\\\\par\\\\smallskip
  }{}%
  \\\\centering
  \\\\begin{tabular}{#1}%
}{%
  \\\\end{tabular}%
  \\\\par\\\\smallskip
}

% Flexible width table
\\\\NewDocumentEnvironment{fntabx}{m O{}}{%
  \\\\par\\\\smallskip
  \\\\refstepcounter{fntablecounter}%
  \\\\IfValueTF{#2}{%
    \\\\noindent\\\\textbf{Table~\\\\thefntablecounter:} #2\\\\par\\\\smallskip
  }{}%
  \\\\centering
  \\\\begin{tabularx}{\\\\linewidth}{#1}%
}{%
  \\\\end{tabularx}%
  \\\\par\\\\smallskip
}

% ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
% CODE BLOCKS IN FOOTNOTES
% ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
\\\\usepackage{listings}
\\\\lstset{
  basicstyle=\\\\ttfamily\\\\footnotesize,
  breaklines=true,
  frame=single,
  framesep=2pt,
  xleftmargin=2pt,
  xrightmargin=2pt
}

\\\\NewDocumentEnvironment{fncode}{O{}}{%
  \\\\par\\\\smallskip
  \\\\lstset{language=#1}%
  \\\\begin{lstlisting}%
}{%
  \\\\end{lstlisting}%
  \\\\par\\\\smallskip
}

% Inline code
\\\\newcommand{\\\\fnc}[1]{\\\\texttt{#1}}
\"
  \"LaTeX preamble for rich footnotes with full document capability.\")

(defun my/insert-latex-rich-footnotes-preamble ()
  \"Insert LaTeX rich footnotes preamble.\"
  (interactive)
  (insert my/latex-rich-footnotes-preamble)
  (message \"LaTeX rich footnotes preamble inserted.\"))
