| Redo | =C-?= |
| Visual undo tree | =C-x u= |
| Focused writing mode | =C-c w= |
| Spell check word | =M-$= |
| Switch to English spelling | =C-c s e= |
| Switch to Hebrew spelling | =C-c s h= |
| Open config | =C-c e i= |
| Reload config | =C-c e r= |
| Get help on keybinding | =C-h k= then press key |
| See all keybindings | Wait after prefix key |

