** Unlimited Sectioning in LaTeX

| Level | Command                       |
|-------+-------------------------------|
| 1     | =\\section{}=                  |
| 2     | =\\subsection{}=               |
| 3     | =\\subsubsection{}=            |
| 4     | =\\paragraph{}=                |
