*** Hebrew Footnote RTL Fix

Hebrew footnotes in Org mode can display as LTR because the footnote marker =[fn:N]= starts with LTR characters. The config automatically inserts a Right-to-Left Mark when creating new footnotes. For existing footnotes, use =C-c h f= to fix them all at once.

